l/approval_expired) 단일 경로\n71:apps/daemon/src/main.ts           엔트리(--dir): Sqlite 저널 + Scheduler + Broker + RPC 서버 + 락\n88:### Task 1: 모노레포·툴체인 (T1)\n95:**Interfaces:**\n108:- [ ] **Step 3: 워크스페이스 생성** — 루트 `package.json`에 `\"workspaces\": [\"packages/*\", \"apps/*\"]`, devDependencies 추가 `better-sqlite3@13.0.3`, `@types/better-sqlite3`, `@napi-rs/keyring@^2.1.2`, `electron@45.2.1`, `react@^19`, `react-dom@^19`, `@types/react`, `@types/react-dom`, `vite@^8`, `@vitejs/plugin-react`, `ajv@^8`(정책 JSON 스키마·RPC params 검증). 빌드·실행 계약(검토 #14): 개발·테스트는 tsc·vitest가 `exports: ./src/index.ts`를 직접 해석; **실행 가능물**은 데몬 = `node --import tsx`(P11a 전까지 dev 런타임, Task 9 CI self-test), Shell = vite 번들(Task 11 CI build). 소스 `exports`만으로 Node가 .ts를 실행할 수 있다고 가정하지 않는다. `packages/protocol/src/index.ts`에 `export const PROTOCOL_PACKAGE = \"@agent-studio/protocol\";`. tsconfig `include`에 `packages/**/*.ts`, `apps/daemon/**/*.ts`, `apps/shell/**/*.ts`, `scripts/**/*.ts`; `apps/renderer/tsconfig.json`은 `extends` 루트 + `lib [\"ES2023\",\"DOM\"]`, `jsx \"react-jsx\"`, include `apps/renderer/src/**/*`. vitest include에 `packages/**/*.test.ts`, `apps/**/*.test.ts`, `scripts/**/*.test.ts`. `npm install` 후 `package-lock.json` 갱신.\n113:### Task 2: Codex 스키마 고정 + CI diff (T10)\n120:**Interfaces:**\n129:### Task 3: Gateway 정식 서명 + FakeGateway (T9)\n135:**Interfaces:**\n136:- Produces(`gateway.ts`, AGENT_INTEGRATION §1 그대로): `interface AgentGateway { capabilities(agent: AgentKind): Promise<Capabilities>; startRun(spec: RunSpec): Promise<RunHandle>; listSessions(agent: AgentKind, filter: {projectDir?: string; includeArchived?: boolean}): Promise<SessionInfo[]>; readSession(ref: SessionRef): Promise<SessionTranscript> }`; `interface RunHandle { readonly runId: string; readonly sessionRef: SessionRef; events(): AsyncIterable<GatewayEvent>; steer(text: string): Promise<SteerResult>; interrupt(): Promise<void>; respond(requestId: string, answer: ApprovalAnswer | UserInputAnswer | ElicitationAnswer): Promise<void